# ለእያንዳንዱ walks a list, collection first — Ahadu's order, as ከሆነ and
# እስከሆነ ድረስ are (§7.4). Before it, every list walk needed a hand-rolled
# counter, which is why every v1 example hardcoded its length.
# expect: አበበ
# expect: ከበደ
# expect: አስቴር
# expect: 10
# expect: አስቴር
ቤተሰብ = ["አበበ"፣ "ከበደ"፣ "አስቴር"]
ቤተሰብ ለእያንዳንዱ ስም፦
    ጻፍ(ስም)

ድምር = 0
[1፣ 2፣ 3፣ 4] ለእያንዳንዱ ቁ፦
    ድምር = ድምር + ቁ
ጻፍ(ድምር)

# The loop variable is defined in the enclosing scope, not one of its own: a
# block introduces no scope anywhere in Ahadu (§5.3), so it survives the loop
# holding the last element visited — exactly as a እስከሆነ ድረስ counter does.
ጻፍ(ስም)
